### =========================================================================
### ACTUATOR & OBSERVABILITY (Health, Metrics, Prometheus)
### =========================================================================

### 4.1 Application Health Check (with DB & Probes)
GET http://{{host}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

> {%
    client.test("Health status is UP", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200);
        client.assert(response.body.status === "UP");
    });
%}

### 4.2 Application Info
GET http://{{host}}/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### 4.3 List All Available Metrics
GET http://{{host}}/actuator/metrics
Accept: application/json

### 4.4 HTTP Server Requests Metric (with percentiles & histogram)
GET http://{{host}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests
Accept: application/json

### 4.5 Prometheus Metrics Scrape Endpoint
GET http://{{host}}/actuator/prometheus
Accept: text/plain

> {%
    client.test("Prometheus metrics endpoint is UP", function() {
        client.assert(response.status === 200);
    });
%}
